  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the quinoa in a fine mesh strainer and drain well.",
    "In a medium saucepan, bring the sake and water to a boil.",
    "Add the quinoa to the saucepan, cover, reduce the heat to low, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "While the quinoa cooks, heat the sesame oil in a small skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped peanuts to the skillet and cook, stirring frequently, until lightly toasted.",
    "Stir in the soy sauce, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Fluff the cooked quinoa with a fork and stir in the toasted peanut mixture.",
    "Top the quinoa with pickled ginger, scallions, and serve immediately."
  ],
